Oozes don't confer see invisible.

The (only?) ways to gain this intrinsic are:

1. Quaffing at a fountain (1 in 30 chance);
2. Sitting on a throne (1 in 11 chance if your luck is >= zero and
   you don't already see invisible);
3. Starting out as an elf;
4. Eating a stalker corpse (if you are already invisible, by any means;
   you will gain intrinsic invisibility AND intrinsic see invisible);
5. Quaffing a blessed potion of see invisible;
6. Wearing the appropriate ring.

There may be more, but I can't think of any just now. Also, I don't
like being permanently invisible, so I don't fancy eating a stalker
corpse. I like to be admitted to shops.

